  "notes": "Jury began deliberations at 2:54 p.m. Court went into recess at 2:55 p.m. with trial continued. Jury recessed deliberations at 4:50 p.m. and will resume tomorrow morning at 9:00 a.m. Total time in court was 4 hours, 13 minutes. Two jury questions (5 and 6) were submitted during trial: (5) 'Is it relevant, permissable or helpful for the jury to know the outcome of the Kim case?' and (6) 'How many staff worked on the meat side and how many on the hide side?'"
}

{
  "Delib_start_time": "4:50 p.m.",
