}

{
  "Final_trial_day": 7,
  "Delib_start_time": null,
  "Delib_end_time": "3:54 p.m.",
  "notes": "Jury resumed deliberations at 9:00 a.m. (deliberations started on a prior day). The Court questioned the jury about an unintentional 'question mark' on the Special Verdict Form; the Foreperson circled and initialed the item. Jury was polled, verdict received at 4:10 p.m., jury excused at 4:11 p.m. Time in court was only 8 minutes. Document is an amended courtroom minutes entry."
}

{
  "Final_trial_day": 4,
  "Delib_start_time": "9:41 a.m.",
  "Delib_end_time": "11:58 a.m.",
  "notes": "There was a mid-deliberation recess (11:00 a.m. to 11:58 a.m.) during which the court addressed jurors' questions with parties; Mr. Polin appeared by phone for that session. After verdict was read, court granted plaintiff's oral request for a permanent injunction enjoining the Board of County Commissioners from enforcing its zoning code in a way that would require the sober living house to be removed, subject to submission of a written order. Total court time recorded as 01:06."
}

{
